{"parse": {"title": "FP-01", "pageid": 64909, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FP-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/FP-02\" title=\"FP-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BC.A6.E6.95.A6.E5.91.BC.E5.8F.AB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"伦敦呼叫\">伦敦呼叫</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 伦敦呼叫</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">London's Calling</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>开<span class=\"color-value\"></span>始<span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>念<span class=\"color-value\"></span>伦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>敦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>切<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>包<span class=\"color-value\"></span>括<span class=\"color-value\"></span>审<span class=\"color-value\"></span>讯<span class=\"color-value\"></span>室<span class=\"color-value\"></span>和<span class=\"color-value\"></span>警<span class=\"color-value\"></span>察<span class=\"color-value\"></span>局<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191601</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jinbishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jinbishi\"><img alt=\"jinbishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/600px-Cg-jinbishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/900px-Cg-jinbishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/1200px-Cg-jinbishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>当然，先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>警署会充分尊重您的人权——在您如实供述一切的前提下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>昨天下午，香榭丽舍大街上发生了一场骚乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>现场的市民目睹了大量的肥皂泡，随后失去了知觉——根据我们的调查，是您制造了这场骚动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>针对以上情况，你有什么想要申辩的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被审讯者听见了久违的母语，不可置信地抬起了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>您是……英国人？不对，您的口音是法国的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>太好了，警官，我来到巴黎以后，没有一个人的英语说得像您这样好！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警察不耐烦地用笔敲了敲桌面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>没有护照，没有入境许可，也没有任何的担保人……您来法国做什么呢？为了特地来这儿引发一场骚乱吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>引发骚乱？不！这绝对不是骚乱，警官！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我看见了，那儿的人们需要一场狂欢，他们相聚在一起，四周被低气压所笼罩……天哪，我简直不敢相信……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警察无奈地扶住了额角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅱ：</div><div>Qu'est-ce qu'il a dit?<br /><i>&lt;他说了什么？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一位警察说话了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黏着的语句，含混的舌音，不明的意义。<br />它们拥塞地挤入了挖掘艺术的耳道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>Je parle dans le vide.<br /><i>&lt;他简直听不懂人话。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他低声地抱怨着，随后继续着他的审问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>先生，这里是警察局——如果你想宣扬你的艺术主张，我会为你联系报社的编辑，他是行内人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>届时，你完全可以对着那位可怜的编辑，陈述你的艺术宣言……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>但是现在——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div><b>我们只想知道那天发生了什么。</b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术瞪大了眼睛——为这从未有过的赏识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦，先生，您是说……您愿意帮我联系编辑……来宣扬我的思想？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>这份无比慷慨的馈赠——我简直是在梦里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>这就是巴黎吗？一个开放、自由、充满包容性的国际化大都市……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>你听不懂人话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他发自内心地询问着，以对方能够听懂的语言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突如其来的敲门声打断了警察的质问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>噢，这位就是挖掘艺术先生？您的装扮相当特别——他说的不错，“立马就能在人群里认出来”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不请自来的客人闯入了审讯室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赶在警察发作之前，他从公文包里掏出了名片，呈递给了两名警官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>……律师？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅰ：</div><div>Et alors? Je ne vais pas laisser des avocats perturber l'interrogatoire!<br /><i>&lt;律师也不能破坏审讯的秩序！&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的同僚显然比他更冷静些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察Ⅱ：</div><div>Oh, un instant. Êtes-vous là à la demande de \"ce monsieur\"?<br /><i>&lt;噢，稍等，请问您的委托人是“那位先生”吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>Oui, monsieur. Si je ne me trompe pas, vous auriez dû être informé.<br /><i>&lt;如果我没有记错，你们应该提前收到过消息。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警察的眉头舒展了，他们随即用法语展开了交流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术茫然地看着眼前的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>律师？哪里来的律师？……难道，这是隶属于人道主义的援助？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他喃喃自语着，警察和律师不约而同地忽视了他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术难得地沉默了，他努力地辨认着陌生的语言，渴望从中得知未来的走向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到他听见了一个词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>重塑……之手？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与此同时，律师与警察的交谈也趋近尾声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>Je vous remercie de votre compréhension.<br /><i>&lt;很荣幸得到您的理解。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>Bonne journée.<br /><i>&lt;祝您有愉快的一天。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>律师向警察脱帽致礼。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随后，他们离开了警局。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jinbishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jinbishi\"><img alt=\"jinbishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/600px-Cg-jinbishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/900px-Cg-jinbishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/1200px-Cg-jinbishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-wurenjiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"wurenjiedao\"><img alt=\"wurenjiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/600px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/900px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/1200px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>挖掘艺术先生，祝贺您，您再次拥有了自由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>如果没有律师的帮助，那您可能需要面临更麻烦的处境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢，非常感谢您的帮助。……但是我没有积蓄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>律师错愕地注视着他，忽然笑得直不起腰来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>哈哈哈……先生，您误解了我的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>对于有些人而言，金钱的份量没有那么重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>很显然，我的委托人就是其中之一——至于更具体的东西，他会亲自和您聊的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>——现在还不是说这些的时候，您做好准备了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他捏碎了一个小东西——也许是什么神秘学道具——它化为齑粉飘扬在空气之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵晕眩率先袭来，其后，眼前的一切开始扭曲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>啊啊——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>这是什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>抓紧我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>行人的喧嚷与汽车的鸣响逐渐远去，四周景物拉扯着变化。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiuguanmidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiuguanmidao\"><img alt=\"jiuguanmidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-jiuguanmidao.png/600px-Cg-jiuguanmidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-jiuguanmidao.png/900px-Cg-jiuguanmidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-jiuguanmidao.png/1200px-Cg-jiuguanmidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>昏暗的酒吧，唯有阶梯上的门透出隐约的光亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>委托人在前面等您，先生，您只要穿过这扇门，就能见到他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>您不为我引荐一下吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>律师笑着摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>还有很多像您一样的神秘学家，正等着我们去拯救——先失陪了，先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>“拯救”？难道有很多人都遇到了艺术上的困境？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">律师：</div><div>哈哈……您果然是一个纯粹的艺术家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>律师并未辩解什么，他脱帽致礼，离开了此地。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zqlm_bg4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zqlm_bg4\"><img alt=\"zqlm_bg4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-zqlm_bg4.png/600px-Cg-zqlm_bg4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-zqlm_bg4.png/900px-Cg-zqlm_bg4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-zqlm_bg4.png/1200px-Cg-zqlm_bg4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>真奇怪，他帮助了我，却又什么都不肯说。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiuguanmidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiuguanmidao\"><img alt=\"jiuguanmidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-jiuguanmidao.png/600px-Cg-jiuguanmidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-jiuguanmidao.png/900px-Cg-jiuguanmidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-jiuguanmidao.png/1200px-Cg-jiuguanmidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他向着眼前的门走去，那儿有更辉煌的亮光。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zqlm_bg4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zqlm_bg4\"><img alt=\"zqlm_bg4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-zqlm_bg4.png/600px-Cg-zqlm_bg4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-zqlm_bg4.png/900px-Cg-zqlm_bg4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-zqlm_bg4.png/1200px-Cg-zqlm_bg4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>酒吧里的客人并不多，他们小声地交谈着，偶尔发出愉悦的低笑——熟悉的语言涌入他的耳道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢，是英语！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>招牌、酒单、装饰字……这里是——英国？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……呵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人发出了一声嗤笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>……一名哗众取宠的艺术家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>在卡纳比街上制造了镜面肥皂泡，导致交通瘫痪的罪魁祸首……您就是挖掘艺术？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>是的，一名艺术家——您没有说错，很高兴遇到您这样志同道合的人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术的眼睛亮了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>至于卡纳比街——那是一次伟大、新型的……将波普艺术带到现实的尝试！虽然它的结果不尽如人意……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>显然，您的“艺术”失败了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>一个狭隘的自我主义者应有的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>什么？自我主义者……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突如其来的指控令他感到困惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>这让你难以接受吗？“爱与和平”先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>——那些人并不认可你的艺术，这是毋庸置疑的事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>诚然，审美力的缺失是时代的通病。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢……所以，你们是艺术家的集会？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>“艺术”这个词太狭隘了，我们所追求的远不止这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>仅需要一个神秘术触媒，就能跨越大洋之间的阻隔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>这就是我们能够做到的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……一个神秘学家专属的艺术集会？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>通行上的便利确实能让艺术的沟通更为便捷……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>勿忘我发出了一声嗤笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我不想加入你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我在伦敦的时候听说过你们，一个离经叛道者的集会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我很喜欢你们的名字——重塑之手，听起来很酷！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>但我想，我的艺术只能自己来完成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人调整了一下面部的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>事实上，我们正在筹划一个“环欧洲巡回游行”，主题是反对战争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>这种游行一般不会有什么好结果，因此，我理解您的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……反对战争的，艺术游行？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>这是我们的愿景，我们也确实希望世界上不会再有战争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢……天哪，看看我差点拒绝了什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>这简直是为我量身打造的艺术活动！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我同意！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FP-01"}}